## Intentions

*   **Purpose:** To provide a set of core AI models for the framework.
*   **Values:**  Accuracy, Transparency
*   **Scope:** Definition of the base models that will be called upon to transform text.
*   **Future Orientation:** Models will be updated, changed, refined over time.

